1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,420
Hold on, Seiya. I'm coming. I'm not sure I'll be able to save you, but I'm your friend, so I have to try.

2
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:12,200
The least I can do is not let you die alone.

3
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:24,640
The air feels so weird. It's like I can sense that chain destruction thing.

4
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:27,500
Uh, guys, I don't like this place.

5
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:29,200
Is this the Demon Lord's castle?

6
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:36,500
Yeah, we're right in the heart of it. And that means what's next will be the final showdown. There's no doubt.

7
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:41,240
Seiya!

8
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:53,760
Oh no! Please don't do it, Seiya!

9
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,520
Omega Valkyriesia!

10
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:58,980
If you use that move, it's gonna kill you!

11
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,100
Gate of Valhalla!

12
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:04,500
Seiya!

13
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:14,300
You broke through my anti-magic field!

14
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:28,700
A Valkyriesia's not magic. So whatever little barrier you put up was destined to fail.

15
00:01:28,700 --> 00:01:29,580
Harvayr!

16
00:01:29,580 --> 00:01:33,600
Oh... well, Vel'cara! This can't be!

17
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:39,880
But how? The only thing that can cause me partly harm is cessation!

18
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:43,640
This must be some kind of illusion, some trick to make me believe it!

19
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:57,660
Whoa! I thought we had him!

20
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,360
He's clawing his way out of the gate!

21
00:01:59,780 --> 00:02:01,600
No, this is not good!

22
00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:05,900
You shouldn't trifle with me, human!

23
00:02:05,900 --> 00:02:10,860
I'd never trifle with an S-ranked demon lord of Gaea Brande.

24
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:14,100
But I have considered your responses to this situation.

25
00:02:16,060 --> 00:02:17,940
Try this, phoenix thrust!

26
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:25,640
So you really does need a sacred sword?

27
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:29,120
You claim to take the fight seriously!

28
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:31,640
You still try to prick me with this needle!

29
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:32,560
Begone!

30
00:02:35,900 --> 00:02:36,540
Master!

31
00:02:36,900 --> 00:02:37,420
Veya!

32
00:02:39,940 --> 00:02:41,320
Eternal Sword EX!

33
00:02:44,620 --> 00:02:47,160
I told you your attacks won't work on me!

34
00:02:47,380 --> 00:02:49,160
Will you foolishly refuse to listen?

35
00:02:51,860 --> 00:02:52,340
No!

36
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:56,180
This isn't a sacred sword, so how can it cut my flesh?

37
00:02:58,180 --> 00:02:59,200
What is that?

38
00:03:00,380 --> 00:03:01,440
No way!

39
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:02,960
It's the doll I made from my hair!

40
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:03,980
This is so embarrassing!

41
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:05,240
I get it now!

42
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:07,420
Master used his synthesis technique!

43
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:09,900
Looks like he used it on the spikes in the gate!

44
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:16,320
An infernal sword, not of this world.

45
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,260
Valhalla thrust!

46
00:03:18,260 --> 00:03:34,000
You took him out!

47
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,960
You took him out!

48
00:03:38,180 --> 00:03:38,880
Way to go!

49
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:39,800
You good?

50
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:42,580
See ya!

51
00:03:44,580 --> 00:03:46,040
It's already getting to you!

52
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,600
Just try to hold on, okay?

53
00:03:49,140 --> 00:03:52,920
Rista, you used some kind of shortcut to get here, didn't you?

54
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:56,220
Whatever happened to following the rules of the Divine Realm?

55
00:03:56,500 --> 00:03:56,880
What?

56
00:03:57,220 --> 00:03:58,920
Why the hell would you bring that up now?

57
00:03:59,100 --> 00:04:02,160
If you die here, you won't be able to go back home, don't you remember?

58
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:05,980
That's true, but I still beat the Demon Lord.

59
00:04:06,180 --> 00:04:08,340
You're the most cautious person in the world!

60
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:11,800
How could you not have figured out how to beat him without dying in the process?

61
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:14,160
I don't know, but...

62
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,000
Master!

63
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,580
I won't let you die here.

64
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:18,720
Rista?

65
00:04:19,260 --> 00:04:21,520
You're not getting away with this, understand me?

66
00:04:21,860 --> 00:04:23,200
You already stood us up!

67
00:04:23,340 --> 00:04:25,620
We were supposed to go out and have some fun!

68
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:30,540
All I wanted was to have a few drinks, play around, hang out at a hot springs in our bathing suits,

69
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:33,320
and actually enjoy a little time together for once.

70
00:04:34,620 --> 00:04:35,060
Order!

71
00:04:35,620 --> 00:04:39,480
Release all the healing power possessed by the Goddess Ristarte right now!

72
00:04:40,380 --> 00:04:43,760
Ristarte, you have violated the rules of the Divine Realm

73
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:46,360
by using a gateway to move to your final location.

74
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:49,960
It's possible our tribunal will strip you of your Goddess Ranking,

75
00:04:50,140 --> 00:04:52,980
and I cannot shield you from this punishment if you go further.

76
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,100
I don't care!

77
00:04:54,540 --> 00:04:55,700
That doesn't scare me!

78
00:04:56,340 --> 00:04:57,380
I've made my peace.

79
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,840
Plus, I'm pretty sure this is why I became a Goddess in the first place,

80
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:02,400
so I'll deal with the consequences!

81
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:04,660
Very well.

82
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:07,540
As long as you understand what's at stake,

83
00:05:07,540 --> 00:05:09,880
I'll grant you all your divine power.

84
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:12,040
Whoa, so cool!

85
00:05:12,340 --> 00:05:13,680
Rista's really amazing!

86
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:14,280
Isn't she?

87
00:05:14,740 --> 00:05:16,840
I may have failed you in my past life,

88
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:19,840
but I believe I was given this power to make up for that failure.

89
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,540
And now, I'm gonna save you.

90
00:05:22,860 --> 00:05:25,240
My healing skill is stronger than the Gate of Valhalla.

91
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:27,120
Hear that?

92
00:05:27,460 --> 00:05:28,500
I learned from you.

93
00:05:28,940 --> 00:05:30,700
This time, I'm perfectly prepared.

94
00:05:30,700 --> 00:05:38,180
Something's going wrong!

95
00:05:38,340 --> 00:05:40,320
The more you heal him, the worse his wounds are getting!

96
00:05:40,620 --> 00:05:41,380
It's okay.

97
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:43,200
Because I'm gonna save you.

98
00:05:43,860 --> 00:05:44,980
I promise I will.

99
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:48,040
Both of us are gonna have a happy ending this time.

100
00:05:48,620 --> 00:05:49,900
Right, Seiya?

101
00:05:49,900 --> 00:06:03,380
Wow, you just saved his life, didn't you?

102
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:04,460
Think so.

103
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:07,000
The recoil from the Gate of Valhalla is over.

104
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:10,520
Master!

105
00:06:10,520 --> 00:06:11,240
I'm right!

106
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:12,960
Hang on.

107
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:15,040
I'm still alive, aren't I?

108
00:06:15,440 --> 00:06:16,380
Yeah, you are!

109
00:06:16,520 --> 00:06:17,380
Thank goodness!

110
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:18,960
It's all thanks to Rista!

111
00:06:19,180 --> 00:06:20,640
It's just like you're a real goddess!

112
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:23,040
Hey, I am a real goddess, thank you!

113
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:26,560
Did you actually save my life just now?

114
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:28,380
Sure did.

115
00:06:28,620 --> 00:06:29,500
It was all me.

116
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:34,860
Hey, what's the matter?

117
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:36,460
Hard pass.

118
00:06:37,380 --> 00:06:38,340
Oh, come on!

119
00:06:38,380 --> 00:06:39,360
Don't be so shy!

120
00:06:39,820 --> 00:06:41,640
I mean, after all we've been through together?

121
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:44,300
We're like the definition of soulmates now!

122
00:06:44,300 --> 00:06:46,500
A little spooch is the very least we could do.

123
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:47,460
Cut it out, okay?

124
00:06:47,700 --> 00:06:49,660
I have no idea what you mean by that.

125
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,560
You don't have to pretend like you don't feel it, too!

126
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:55,220
You are so good as I command you to kiss me!

127
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:57,660
If you don't back off now, I'm gonna punch you.

128
00:06:57,900 --> 00:06:58,300
Wow!

129
00:06:58,580 --> 00:07:01,800
Since you're such a tsundere type, this actually means that you love me, doesn't it?

130
00:07:01,940 --> 00:07:05,700
You only act like this because you're embarrassed how strong your feelings really are!

131
00:07:07,140 --> 00:07:08,560
I warned you, didn't I?

132
00:07:08,900 --> 00:07:09,900
Please, punch drunk!

133
00:07:09,940 --> 00:07:11,200
You think that was a tad excessive?

134
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:14,060
You do know that if I die here, I can't come back either!

135
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:16,020
You say that like it's a bad thing.

136
00:07:16,220 --> 00:07:17,540
I should slug you!

137
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:22,000
Then again, it's pretty impressive that you were able to heal me.

138
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:26,600
All right, I'll admit you're slightly more useful than a medicinal herb.

139
00:07:27,140 --> 00:07:28,720
Abusive and a jerk, too!

140
00:07:28,820 --> 00:07:29,240
Wait!

141
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:29,720
Huh?

142
00:07:30,140 --> 00:07:30,960
Hey, Rista.

143
00:07:31,500 --> 00:07:31,840
Huh?

144
00:07:32,060 --> 00:07:35,340
Do you know why the Gate of Valhalla hasn't disappeared?

145
00:07:35,340 --> 00:07:50,520
Take you all down with me!

146
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:53,680
Annihilate you in this entire world in one fell swoop!

147
00:07:54,140 --> 00:07:55,200
Judgment Zero!

148
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:59,780
What was I thinking?

149
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,960
I should have known it wouldn't be this easy.

150
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:06,520
And that ball of black light has the power to destroy the world twice over.

151
00:08:07,220 --> 00:08:09,760
Everything on this planet will be turned to dust.

152
00:08:10,540 --> 00:08:11,680
That means us too.

153
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:13,160
This is it.

154
00:08:13,280 --> 00:08:14,440
Not on my watch.

155
00:08:17,960 --> 00:08:19,520
Gate of Valhalla!

156
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:21,200
Don't do it, Xeia!

157
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,640
Once more!

158
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:32,760
Damn you!

159
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,580
Beating by a lonely human!

160
00:08:35,020 --> 00:08:36,300
You'll pay for this!

161
00:08:36,300 --> 00:08:51,640
So, is it over this time?

162
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,080
You know, for good?

163
00:08:54,380 --> 00:08:56,400
Now don't get yourself all worked up!

164
00:08:56,460 --> 00:08:58,500
Both he and the first gate have been swallowed!

165
00:08:58,980 --> 00:09:00,600
That thing's talking to us!

166
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:05,080
The Demon Lord has been taken from this world and thrown into the void!

167
00:09:05,460 --> 00:09:06,940
Time to collect my payment!

168
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,360
The life of the Caster!

169
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:10,420
That is the cost of summoning me!

170
00:09:11,020 --> 00:09:11,920
No way!

171
00:09:12,300 --> 00:09:13,580
Don't worry, Xeia!

172
00:09:13,780 --> 00:09:15,280
I swear I'll save you again!

173
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:19,340
What's happening to you?

174
00:09:19,940 --> 00:09:21,740
This is different from last time.

175
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:24,340
Xeia!

176
00:09:24,380 --> 00:09:24,660
Master!

177
00:09:25,180 --> 00:09:25,740
Xeia!

178
00:09:25,740 --> 00:09:30,960
Oh, no!

179
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:33,620
He's falling apart faster than I can heal him!

180
00:09:33,860 --> 00:09:35,140
You are far too naive!

181
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:40,560
It's extremely foolish to believe that a mere human could ever escape the gate of Valhalla's toll more than once!

182
00:09:40,660 --> 00:09:41,940
Shut up, gate face!

183
00:09:42,300 --> 00:09:43,440
Hang in there, Xeia!

184
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:48,800
I need to concentrate and focus all my energy into healing him!

185
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:55,960
Why is this all happening?

186
00:09:56,460 --> 00:09:57,860
Xeia just saved this world!

187
00:09:58,260 --> 00:09:59,360
Don't kill him!

188
00:10:01,260 --> 00:10:02,860
I don't care what he's done!

189
00:10:02,980 --> 00:10:05,900
I'm just a servant of the underworld, here to collect payment!

190
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:13,980
Chain destruction doesn't exist in the Divine Realm, so if we go back there, maybe Xeia won't die for real!

191
00:10:14,140 --> 00:10:17,740
He should be able to go back to his original world if he dies, so open up a portal!

192
00:10:17,740 --> 00:10:18,940
I can't!

193
00:10:19,220 --> 00:10:23,640
Look, if I take my focus off healing him for even a second, he's gonna fall apart!

194
00:10:24,220 --> 00:10:24,700
No!

195
00:10:25,300 --> 00:10:25,960
Hey, Squirt.

196
00:10:26,420 --> 00:10:28,480
Thanks for helping me out with the War Master.

197
00:10:29,140 --> 00:10:30,120
Save your strength!

198
00:10:30,420 --> 00:10:35,000
If it weren't for your support magic, I probably would have been killed in that fight.

199
00:10:35,300 --> 00:10:37,220
But now, you're dying!

200
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:40,480
If I had turned into that sword, you'd be fine!

201
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:43,680
You wouldn't have to give up your own life for this!

202
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:44,640
I'm sorry!

203
00:10:44,640 --> 00:10:52,200
Little bro, now that the Four Heavenly Kings and Demon Lord are history, there's no one in this world that you can't beat.

204
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:55,980
You're gonna need to work with Rosalie and keep things safe around here.

205
00:10:56,340 --> 00:10:58,060
You can't just leave us, Master!

206
00:10:58,620 --> 00:10:59,320
Please stay!

207
00:10:59,900 --> 00:11:02,360
They never even got the chance to properly thank you!

208
00:11:02,420 --> 00:11:03,120
Stop it!

209
00:11:03,460 --> 00:11:04,860
Stop talking like that!

210
00:11:04,860 --> 00:11:08,020
I said I would save you, so that's what I'm gonna do!

211
00:11:10,580 --> 00:11:11,540
But why?

212
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,020
You should be healing!

213
00:11:13,660 --> 00:11:14,960
Why is this happening?

214
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,900
It's over for me, Rista.

215
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:18,580
You can't give up!

216
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,480
Don't let it in like this!

217
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:24,040
I failed you in my past life, but I'm a goddess now!

218
00:11:24,620 --> 00:11:25,940
This isn't right!

219
00:11:25,940 --> 00:11:26,900
It's okay.

220
00:11:27,860 --> 00:11:29,300
You did the best that you could.

221
00:11:31,100 --> 00:11:32,620
But it wasn't enough.

222
00:11:33,700 --> 00:11:36,460
A goddess should be able to save a friend's life, right?

223
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:39,620
I'm useless.

224
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:42,860
I can't help you when you need it the most.

225
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:44,300
I'm so sorry.

226
00:11:44,500 --> 00:11:45,040
It's weird.

227
00:11:45,040 --> 00:11:46,980
This feels familiar.

228
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:49,140
Like it's all happened before.

229
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:51,200
I get it now.

230
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:52,880
It's you.

231
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:54,720
You're why...

232
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:55,980
You're why I'm here.

233
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:03,620
I'm so glad that I was actually able to save you this time.

234
00:12:15,040 --> 00:12:41,480
So you're really leaving?

235
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:48,180
Thanks to all your work in defeating the Demon Lord, Gaya Brande has been saved.

236
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:51,920
We should throw a parade of honor and give you a huge reward at least.

237
00:12:52,180 --> 00:12:53,480
Don't worry about that.

238
00:12:53,980 --> 00:12:58,200
And besides, the one who really deserves the praise gave up his life for this world.

239
00:12:59,260 --> 00:13:01,680
Oh yeah, you're right.

240
00:13:02,580 --> 00:13:03,880
But let me say one thing.

241
00:13:05,020 --> 00:13:09,260
He may not have cared about what others thought of him, and he could come off as somewhat harsh,

242
00:13:09,260 --> 00:13:11,940
but Seiya always stuck to what he truly believed in.

243
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:16,720
And the way I see it, that's the defining quality of a bona fide hero.

244
00:13:17,040 --> 00:13:17,720
It's true.

245
00:13:17,980 --> 00:13:23,520
And everything he accomplished on Gaya Brande was something no ordinary hero could have ever dreamed of pulling off.

246
00:13:24,500 --> 00:13:31,060
For their part in defeating the Demon Lord, Mosh and Elulu, our little dragonkin friends, were both knighted by Rosalie.

247
00:13:31,400 --> 00:13:33,100
I know you're gonna do great things.

248
00:13:33,560 --> 00:13:34,120
Thank you.

249
00:13:34,580 --> 00:13:35,760
Masters save this world.

250
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:38,880
So I have to do everything I can to keep it safe.

251
00:13:39,260 --> 00:13:39,880
Huh?

252
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:44,420
Don't worry, cause I'll be washing over him.

253
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:45,280
Hmm.

254
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:47,900
Well, that does ease my mind a little.

255
00:13:49,560 --> 00:13:51,620
You really gonna go back home, Rista?

256
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:52,700
I am.

257
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:54,640
I can't stay here forever, you know.

258
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:56,320
I'll miss you!

259
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:57,740
I'll miss you too.

260
00:13:58,140 --> 00:13:59,580
Come back and see us sometime.

261
00:13:59,940 --> 00:14:01,100
We can go to the hot springs.

262
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,720
We still need to hit the casino.

263
00:14:03,140 --> 00:14:03,700
You're right.

264
00:14:04,020 --> 00:14:05,160
Sounds like fun to me.

265
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:06,220
You promise?

266
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:07,180
You'll really visit?

267
00:14:07,180 --> 00:14:09,900
Yeah, of course I will.

268
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:13,240
Alright, this is it.

269
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:15,240
Goddess Ristarte.

270
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:16,100
Huh?

271
00:14:16,740 --> 00:14:18,240
Losing my father hurts.

272
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:22,180
But your strength has truly inspired me.

273
00:14:22,180 --> 00:14:23,760
I'm not that strong.

274
00:14:24,300 --> 00:14:24,800
But...

275
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:28,780
I know that I owe it to Seiya to be the very best goddess that I can be.

276
00:14:29,260 --> 00:14:30,340
That's what keeps me going.

277
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:33,600
Guess that's how I should approach things, too.

278
00:14:34,220 --> 00:14:36,200
I have to lead this empire forward.

279
00:14:36,740 --> 00:14:39,020
I know it will be in good hands with you.

280
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:42,380
But all I ask is that you make sure to take care of those two.

281
00:14:42,740 --> 00:14:44,680
Don't give them any crazy orders, okay?

282
00:14:45,460 --> 00:14:46,680
I'll keep that in mind.

283
00:14:46,680 --> 00:14:51,680
Now give our savior goddess a salute!

284
00:15:07,100 --> 00:15:09,500
The two of them look so grown up just now.

285
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:11,800
I'm so proud of how far they've come.

286
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:18,120
So you're just gonna slack off again.

287
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:19,960
Seiya?

288
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:43,500
He's really gone.

289
00:15:43,500 --> 00:15:43,520
He's really gone.

290
00:15:43,520 --> 00:16:08,540
I could swear I locked the door.

291
00:16:09,540 --> 00:16:12,280
Locked doors mean nothing to the goddess of opening seals.

292
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:16,240
Sorry to drop in unannounced.

293
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,940
Ishtar is asking for you.

294
00:16:18,940 --> 00:16:20,320
Okay, thank you.

295
00:16:20,680 --> 00:16:21,240
I'm coming.

296
00:16:21,800 --> 00:16:22,080
Goodness.

297
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:23,980
Looking a little rough.

298
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:25,980
Let me fix your hair for you.

299
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:29,980
You know, if I had to guess,

300
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:33,940
I'm pretty sure that Ishtar needs to speak with you about opening that shortcut portal

301
00:16:33,940 --> 00:16:36,740
and releasing your goddess powers back in Gea Brande.

302
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:37,680
Yeah.

303
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:39,700
I know I'll be punished for that.

304
00:16:40,160 --> 00:16:42,560
I knew I was breaking the rules when I did it.

305
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:44,580
You needn't worry.

306
00:16:45,060 --> 00:16:48,020
After all, that world was a level S and you still saved it.

307
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:50,620
I'll try to make sure that's taken into consideration.

308
00:16:51,620 --> 00:16:53,800
Now, you're looking much better.

309
00:16:56,800 --> 00:16:58,740
Honestly, I wish I felt better.

310
00:16:58,740 --> 00:17:11,360
Rista, I really hope that you're doing okay.

311
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:13,280
Oh, I'm sure I'll be fine.

312
00:17:13,540 --> 00:17:15,520
But I appreciate your concern, Adonela.

313
00:17:16,120 --> 00:17:19,040
I know you were fond of Seiya too, so it means a lot.

314
00:17:19,420 --> 00:17:22,660
Well, I'm way more concerned about you than I am about me.

315
00:17:23,120 --> 00:17:26,540
I'm sad, but it's probably nothing compared to what you're feeling right now.

316
00:17:27,420 --> 00:17:28,400
Hey there, Rista.

317
00:17:28,820 --> 00:17:31,600
I heard you were down in the dump, so here's something that might help.

318
00:17:31,820 --> 00:17:33,720
At least your taste buds will be happy.

319
00:17:34,180 --> 00:17:36,380
I'm trying a new thing with this frozen cake.

320
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:39,060
You really think a cake is going to make it better?

321
00:17:39,280 --> 00:17:40,720
Have you lost your damn mind?

322
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:43,540
Sorry, I, uh...

323
00:17:43,540 --> 00:17:45,880
No, Rista, don't force it.

324
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:46,920
It's so delicious.

325
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:49,240
Didn't know I liked protein cake.

326
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:51,720
Well, this one's actually a frozen cake.

327
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:54,520
Then I guess I'm a fan of frozen protein cakes.

328
00:17:54,660 --> 00:17:56,820
I think you may be misunderstanding me.

329
00:17:57,260 --> 00:17:59,240
It's not a protein cake of any...

330
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:03,800
Okay, still, it has protein.

331
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:05,860
Yeah, of course, there's plenty in there.

332
00:18:06,020 --> 00:18:07,040
Gotta build those muscles.

333
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:10,960
I think if you cut back on that a little bit, the next one will turn out way better.

334
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:11,920
But thanks.

335
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:15,640
Oh no, in my opinion, he should add even more next time.

336
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:19,820
Personally speaking, I can't seem to ever get enough of that manly protein.

337
00:18:20,220 --> 00:18:22,340
You should go back to your forest right now, Midas.

338
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:24,360
If Ishtar sees you, she'll get angry.

339
00:18:24,580 --> 00:18:26,120
Let me enjoy myself a second.

340
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:31,080
I was only out here looking to see if there was a hunky new hero, so...

341
00:18:31,080 --> 00:18:32,180
Midas!

342
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:34,380
Oh, you biddies are just no fun.

343
00:18:34,380 --> 00:18:36,020
Bye for now, Restarte.

344
00:18:36,260 --> 00:18:38,140
I hope you have a wonderful day.

345
00:18:38,340 --> 00:18:39,060
You too.

346
00:18:41,660 --> 00:18:52,580
I really wouldn't worry about this too much if I were you.

347
00:18:52,580 --> 00:18:58,380
Nice work, Restarte.

348
00:18:58,740 --> 00:18:59,920
Really pulled it off.

349
00:19:00,740 --> 00:19:05,360
I heard what happened to your hero, but I don't regret teaching him that move.

350
00:19:06,040 --> 00:19:07,200
That's just what it took.

351
00:19:08,040 --> 00:19:08,760
Guess so.

352
00:19:09,100 --> 00:19:10,980
Man, you really look like crap.

353
00:19:11,620 --> 00:19:14,180
But to be honest, that's a step up for you.

354
00:19:15,060 --> 00:19:16,320
That a compliment?

355
00:19:16,320 --> 00:19:21,260
I'd like to paint your portrait sometime, but only if you promise you won't look like

356
00:19:21,260 --> 00:19:23,140
a kid who just lost her lollipop.

357
00:19:28,140 --> 00:19:32,200
Rista, I'm extremely proud that you were able to save Gaea Brande.

358
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:36,760
And seeing that you've returned home safe and unharmed makes me very happy.

359
00:19:37,080 --> 00:19:37,660
Thank you.

360
00:19:37,660 --> 00:19:43,660
My feelings notwithstanding, the Divine Realm Tribunal deliberated on your violation of

361
00:19:43,660 --> 00:19:45,360
rules and has come to a decision.

362
00:19:45,940 --> 00:19:48,180
Whatever the punishment is, you must accept it.

363
00:19:48,180 --> 00:19:48,980
Excuse me.

364
00:19:49,620 --> 00:19:53,360
Although Restarte broke the rules regarding protocol, she did save that world.

365
00:19:53,940 --> 00:19:58,080
I ask that you give her success due consideration when handing down the penalty.

366
00:19:59,080 --> 00:20:00,740
I have considered that.

367
00:20:00,740 --> 00:20:05,740
And your punishment will be to save the double-S difficulty world, Ixphoria.

368
00:20:06,860 --> 00:20:09,940
But that's a world that's already been conquered by a Demon Lord!

369
00:20:10,180 --> 00:20:14,760
He killed our hero, gained immense power, and turned the whole place into a demonic realm!

370
00:20:15,220 --> 00:20:17,240
Please allow me to go there in her place!

371
00:20:17,380 --> 00:20:18,180
I will not.

372
00:20:18,620 --> 00:20:19,280
I beg you!

373
00:20:19,360 --> 00:20:20,260
Take heed, Rista.

374
00:20:20,820 --> 00:20:25,860
While on your mission to save Ixphoria, your divine powers of healing will be unavailable to you.

375
00:20:25,860 --> 00:20:30,780
If the mission fails, you will forevermore lose your status as goddess.

376
00:20:31,040 --> 00:20:35,760
But Ishtar, that world has already taken so much from her, isn't there some other way she can atone?

377
00:20:36,300 --> 00:20:37,380
It's way too harsh!

378
00:20:37,580 --> 00:20:44,360
And if she doesn't have the power to meaningfully support her hero, saving a world as far gone as that one won't just be hard, it'll be completely impossible!

379
00:20:44,860 --> 00:20:46,180
I don't see it that way.

380
00:20:46,680 --> 00:20:49,480
In fact, I don't believe it will be impossible in the slightest.

381
00:20:49,740 --> 00:20:51,020
How can you say that?

382
00:20:51,020 --> 00:20:56,200
And what kind of hero could realistically save a Hellscape that's under the control of a bloodthirsty demon?

383
00:20:57,640 --> 00:20:58,840
Please forgive me.

384
00:21:00,160 --> 00:21:07,220
When the second gate of Valhalla was used to defeat this last Demon Lord, it also swallowed up the effects of the chain destruction.

385
00:21:08,020 --> 00:21:09,660
So, what does that mean?

386
00:21:10,660 --> 00:21:14,580
Ordinarily, when one fails a world, they can never return to it.

387
00:21:15,860 --> 00:21:17,020
But...

388
00:21:21,020 --> 00:21:31,860
Restarte, in order to take back control of the double-S level world, Ixphoria, you must summon a hero from this list only.

389
00:21:32,080 --> 00:21:32,760
No exceptions.

390
00:21:37,280 --> 00:21:41,680
The ability levels have been reset to less than a thousandth of what they were.

391
00:21:41,860 --> 00:21:43,640
I think he'll do just fine.

392
00:21:45,040 --> 00:21:45,560
Thanks.

393
00:21:45,560 --> 00:21:52,580
Written at the bottom was something I once thought of as a disadvantage.

394
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:57,160
Now I know it can take down a Demon Lord and save a world on the brink of destruction.

395
00:21:57,780 --> 00:22:00,340
A trait that kept me alive despite all the danger.

396
00:22:01,020 --> 00:22:05,560
And a mindset that can only be granted through reflection on one's past mistakes.

